.
.  Generate a dex interaction effects matrix
.
dimension 25 variables
device 1 x11
set ipl1na dexscat1.ps
device 2 postscript
device 1 font simplex
thickness 0.2
.
SKIP 50
read JAHANMI2.DAT run lab bar set y x1 to x8 batch
let y1 = y
let y2 = y
retain y1 subset batch 1
retain y2 subset batch 2
skip 0
.
. Generate Matrix of Dex Interaction Effects
.
multiplot corner coordinates 10 5 90 95
retain y x1 x2 x3 subset batch = 1
tic label size 10
label size 10
y1label displacement 20
y2label displacement 30
ylimits 500 800
major ytic mark number 4
char x
char size 4
line blank
xlimits -1 1
major xtic mark number 2
xtic offset 0.2 0.2
ytic offset 25 25
xtic marks off
xtic mark labels off
.
set matrix plot type dex interactions
set matrix plot lower diagonal off
. set matrix plot corr on
.
scatter plot matrix y x1 x2 x3 subset batch = 1
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv DEXSCAT1.PS dexscat1.ps
quit
